# FujiNet Operation Manual for the Heathkit H89

*How to install and use the H89 FujiNet card: setting its jumpers, putting it in the Computer, checking it with a program keyed into the monitor, joining your WiFi with FujiNet CONFIG, and using the FujiNet's eight drives from HDOS (FN0:–FN7:) and CP/M (D:–K:) with the FNDISK drivers.*

<img src="images/h89-operation-cover-board.png" width="640" alt="The H89 FujiNet card, printed in the brown and gold of a 1979 Heathkit manual cover">

The printed edition, styled after Heath's 1979 *H88 Operation Manual*, is in the [fujinet-manuals](https://github.com/FujiNetWIFI/fujinet-manuals) repository under `h89/operation-manual/`.

